<title>USA: Eurotronics cancels reverse split.</title>
<headline>Eurotronics cancels reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY, Utah 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotronics Holdings Inc said Thursday it would not go through with plans for a 1-for-10 reverse split of its common stock.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Eurotronics originally agreed to the reverse split in July, but that the move was never announced publicly.</p>
